<Layout lang="en" title="About — Pip24h" description="Who Pip24h is and how we review forex and crypto brokers.">
	<article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
		<h1>About Pip24h</h1>

		<p>
			Pip24h is an independent review site for forex and crypto brokers, built to give traders clear,
			comparable information before choosing where to open an account.
		</p>

		<h2>How we review</h2>
		<p>Every broker on Pip24h is assessed against the same core criteria:</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Trading fees</strong> — spreads, commissions, overnight fees.</li>
			<li><strong>Trustworthiness</strong> — regulatory licenses, track record.</li>
			<li><strong>Deposit/withdrawal speed</strong> — actual processing times, not marketing claims.</li>
			<li><strong>Trading platforms</strong> — MetaTrader, cTrader, proprietary apps, and more.</li>
			<li><strong>User experience</strong> — customer support, interface, documentation.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>How we're funded</h2>
		<p>
			Pip24h stays free for readers through affiliate links — see our
			<a href="/en/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details. Whether a broker runs an
			affiliate program or not does not change our actual assessment of it.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>If you have feedback, spot outdated information, or want to collaborate, reach out via the email listed on the site.</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
